{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"68d84534612c555ed5acd612f61b248c7b4112db9683a0204991b13a498f84cb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["預言有人離棄真道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["聖靈明說，在後來的時候，必有人離棄真道，聽從那引誘人的邪靈和鬼魔的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這是因為說謊之人的假冒；這等人的良心如同被熱鐵烙慣了一般。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他們禁止嫁娶，又禁戒食物",{"noteId":4},"，就是上帝所造、叫那信而明白真道的人感謝着領受的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["凡上帝所造的物都是好的，若感謝着領受，就沒有一樣可棄的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["都因上帝的道和人的祈求成為聖潔了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督耶穌的好執事"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你若將這些事提醒弟兄們，便是基督耶穌的好執事，在真道的話語和你向來所服從的善道上得了教育。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["只是要棄絕那世俗的言語和老婦荒渺的話，在敬虔上操練自己。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「操練身體，益處還少；惟獨敬虔，凡事都有益處，因有今生和來生的應許。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這話是可信的，是十分可佩服的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們勞苦努力，正是為此，因我們的指望在乎永生的上帝；他是萬人的救主，更是信徒的救主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["這些事，你要吩咐人，也要教導人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不可叫人小看你年輕，總要在言語、行為、愛心、信心、清潔上，都作信徒的榜樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要以宣讀、勸勉、教導為念，直等到我來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你不要輕忽所得的恩賜，就是從前藉着預言、在眾長老按手的時候賜給你的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這些事你要殷勤去做，並要在此專心，使眾人看出你的長進來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你要謹慎自己和自己的教訓，要在這些事上恆心；因為這樣行，又能救自己，又能救聽你的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：又叫人戒葷","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}